join='''<p class="intro">Work with us on machine learning for healthcare and biomedical discovery.</p><p>We welcome enquiries from motivated prospective PhD students, postdoctoral researchers and visiting PhD students with a background in machine learning, control science, mathematics, bioinformatics, healthcare or related fields.</p><div class="notice"><strong>Start a conversation</strong><p>For PhD enquiries, please complete the application enquiry form. You are also welcome to contact Hongpeng directly about research fit and potential opportunities.</p><a class="button" href="https://forms.gle/Lb5VEhT4vzHMJL1q6">PhD enquiry form ↗</a><a href="mailto:hongpeng.zhou@manchester.ac.uk">Email Hongpeng</a></div><h2>PhD funding &amp; applications</h2><p>Funding schemes have their own eligibility requirements and deadlines. Check the scheme’s current call and contact us to discuss project availability. Self-funded and part-time PhD enquiries are also welcome.</p>'''+ul(p[18:24])+para(p[24])+'''<h2>Postdoctoral enquiries</h2><p>Please contact us to discuss a potential project and suitable fellowship routes. The following schemes were listed on our group’s website; current calls and eligibility should be checked with each funder.</p>'''+ul(p[4:9])+'''<details><summary>Previous funded PhD opportunities · 2023–2025</summary><p class="muted">Historical project announcements, retained for reference. These are not a list of currently open positions.</p>'''+ul(p[11:18])+'</details>'
